.	http://www.emsl.pnl.gov/ecce:annotation		ECCE-QM, B3LYP-D3(BJ)/def2-SVP, transition-state optimisation and frequencies, orbitals localised. This calculation shows the direct 1,3-hydrogen shift from acetone to propen-2-ol without water, with one imaginary mode at -2115.91 cm-1, the hydrogen bridging carbon and oxygen across a four-membered ring (C-H 1.506 Å, O-H 1.281 Å; among the localised orbitals a delocalised C2-H3-C1 bond), and an electronic energy of -192.799160 Eh, 279.3 kJ/mol above acetone.
.	http://www.emsl.pnl.gov/ecce:application		ECCE-QM
